        "content": {
          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m048-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "On Sunday, Ava works in the garden with Grandpa. There is a big tree and green grass. Ava puts a seed in the soil. Grandpa says, “Water the seed.” A flower grows next to the tree. Ava sees a green leaf and smiles. The garden is full of life."
